# Optional: Gemini thinking budget in tokens, applied to every direct Gemini call
# (specialist agents, think/reflect, summarize_context) and to get_llm() when using
# the google provider. 0 disables thinking, -1 enables dynamic thinking (model
# decides), a positive integer caps thinking tokens. Leave unset to use the
# provider's default. See https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/thinking#set-budget
THINKING_BUDGET=